  "contentHtml": "<p>저는 제 사진과 함께 스토리 프롬프트를 줘서 만화를 만들어서 아이들에게 많이 보여줍니다!</p><p>예시들을 올려드립니다^^</p><p>선생님들만의 설명 방식과 노하우를 만화 스토리에 녹여서 시각 자료와 함께 제공한다면 학생들의 집중도가 올라갈 것 같습니다!</p><p>저는 만화를 읽어줄 때 목소리도 막 바꾸면서... 원맨쇼를 합니다...</p><p>해누리 아이들은 고맙게도 참 재밌어해줍니다 ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eff3f47c5a54cf16fb694028b548231ebeb4db4d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eff3f47c5a54cf16fb694028b548231ebeb4db4d\" data-origin-width=\"847\" data-origin-height=\"1264\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e35203bd561c7b454bdee1a493b2a339e8181a5e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e35203bd561c7b454bdee1a493b2a339e8181a5e\" data-origin-width=\"1408\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22a914f3cc6f231c7eb6229ff595bbf7eba52671\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/22a914f3cc6f231c7eb6229ff595bbf7eba52671\" data-origin-width=\"669\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/65337b659124468f729fa41d5e85626d0fb895db\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/65337b659124468f729fa41d5e85626d0fb895db\" data-origin-width=\"1408\" data-origin-height=\"768\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
